{"about_the_game":"Swapper Tiles is a first person puzzle game where you play as a robot trapped in a cage with only one way to escape. You must complete all challenges set by your captors. The challenges include complete puzzles by swapping them to create a path between them. This game includes the levels needed to escape the cage as well as a level generator to creating your own levels. You can customise the colour of the three parts of the tiles: connector, center and the back. If you have any feedback, please email me so i can try to change the game to make it better. Demo is available below.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/801660?t=1752523633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/801660?t=1752523633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752523633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752523633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":861130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Swapper Tiles is a first person puzzle game where you play as a robot trapped in a cage with only one way to escape. You must complete all challenges set by your captors. The challenges include complete puzzles by swapping them to create a path between them. This game includes the levels needed to escape the cage as well as a level generator to creating your own levels. You can customise the colour of the three parts of the tiles: connector, center and the back. If you have any feedback, please email me so i can try to change the game to make it better. Demo is available below.","developers":["Rynder Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://share